PWA (Progressive Web App) mein service worker version badalne aur naye assets (jaise naya logo aur icon) ko live karne ke liye aapko niche diye gaye steps ko step-by-step follow karna hoga.
Aap apne code editor (jaise VS Code) mein apni project repository kholein aur ye badlaav karein:
Step 1: Service Worker File (sw.js ya service-worker.js) Kholein
Apne project folder ke main layout mein (aamtaur par public/ folder ya root folder mein) sw.js ya service-worker.js naam ki file ko kholein.
Step 2: Cache Name (Version) ko Update Karein
File ke sabse upar aapko ek cache name ka variable dikhega. Use badalkar naya version number de dein:
Purana Code (Kucch aisa dikhega):
javascript
const CACHE_NAME = 'saheb-world-cache-v1'; 
// ya fir variable ka naam sirf 'cacheName' ho sakta hai
Use code with caution.
Naya Code (Aise badlein):
javascript
const CACHE_NAME = 'saheb-world-cache-v2'; // Version v1 se v2 kar dein
Use code with caution.
Step 3: Purane Cache ko Delete karne ka Code Jodein (Activate Event)
Kewal version badalna kafi nahi hota, browser ko batana padta hai ki woh purane assets ko delete karein. Apni service worker file mein check karein ki kya activate event ka code niche diye gaye tareeqe se likha hai ya nahi. Agar nahi hai, toh ise copy-paste karke file ke end mein jod dein:
javascript
self.addEventListener('activate', (event) => {
  const cacheWhitelist = [CACHE_NAME];
  event.waitUntil(
    caches.keys().then((cacheNames) => {
      return Promise.all(
        cacheNames.map((cacheName) => {
          // Agar purana cache whitelist mein nahi hai, toh use delete karein
          if (cacheWhitelist.indexOf(cacheName) === -1) {
            return caches.delete(cacheName);
          }
        })
      );
    }).then(() => {
      // Naye service worker ko turant active karne ke liye
      return self.clients.claim();
    })
  );
});
Use code with caution.
Step 4: Manifest File mein Icons ka Version Badlein (Cache-Busting)
Agar aapne naya icon upload kiya hai aur uska naam purane file jaisa hi hai (jaise icon.png), toh browser use purana samajh kar skip kar deta hai. Isko bypass karne ke liye:
Apni manifest.json file kholein.
Jahan bhi icons ke path diye hain, unke aage ?v=2 jod dein. Isse Vercel aur browser ko majbooran naye assets download karne padte hain:
json
"icons": [
  {
    "src": "/icons/icon-192x192.png?v=2",
    "sizes": "192x192",
    "type": "image/png"
  },
  {
    "src": "/icons/icon-512x512.png?v=2",
    "sizes": "512x512",
    "type": "image/png"
  }
]
Use code with caution.
Step 5: Code ko GitHub par Push Karein
Apne terminal mein jaakar in badlaav ko GitHub par push kar dein:
bash
git add .
git commit -m "Updated service worker version to v2 for cache busting"
git push origin main
Use code with caution.
