Apne Vercel Dashboard par jaakar check karein ki naya deployment complete (Green) ho gaya hai.
Apne mobile phone mein Saheb World APK ki settings mein jaakar Clear Cache aur Clear Data karein.
App ko dobara kholein, aapka naya Maghar Swaroop wala icon aur updated layout bilkul sahi dikhne lagega!
