Vite PWA
Agar aapko vite.config.ts ke andar VitePWA ka block dhoodhne mein koi dikkat aa rahi hai, toh aap mujhe apni vite.config.ts file ka poora text copy karke chat mein bhej dein, main aapko sahi jagah par code set karke de dunga!




Aapki vite.config.ts file bilkul sahi tarike se configure hai aur isme registerType: 'autoUpdate' pehle se hi set hai.
Lekin dikkat yeh hai ki aapne runtimeCaching ke andar images aur media ke liye CacheFirst strategy lagayi hui hai aur uski expiry 60 din (maxAgeSeconds) set hai. Jab tak yeh 60 din poore nahi honge ya cache break nahi hoga, mobile app purane assets ko hi dikhati rahegi.
Ise force-update (cache-bust) karne ke liye niche diye gaye code ko poora copy karein aur apni vite.config.ts file ke andar paste kar dein (Isme maine aapke icons aur images ke paths ke aage query strings (?v=3) jod di hain taaki Vercel aur app wrapper use ek naya asset samajhkar turant download karein):
