🛠️ Code Delete aur Paste karne ka Sahi Tarika:
Pehle pura select karein: Jaisa aapne screenshot mein kiya hai, Select All par click karein taaki poora code blue color mein select ho jaye.
Keyboard ka backspace dabaayein: "Cut" par click karne ki jagah, apne mobile keyboard ka Delete / Backspace (❌ ya ⌫ icon) button daba dein. Isse poora text ek baar mein gayab ho jayega aur file bilkul khali ho jayegi.
Naya code paste karein: Khali jagah par thodi der ungli dabakar rakhein (Long Press) aur Paste par click kar dein.
Save karein: Pura naya code aane ke baad, upar right side mein diye gaye Commit changes... button par click karke save kar dein.
Agar keyboard se bhi delete karne mein koi pareshani aa rahi ho, toh mujhe batayein taaki main koi aur shortcut ya tarika dhoondh sakoon!




Mobile browsers (jaise Chrome) mein GitHub ka code editor thoda buggy hota hai, isliye wahan text ko select aur delete karne mein dikkat aati hai.
Aap pareshan mat hoiye, iska ek 100% foolproof aur sabse aasan tarika hai jisme aapko purana code delete karne ki mehnat hi nahi karni padegi. Hum pehle is file ko delete karenge aur fir naye code ke sath turant dobara bana denge:
Step 1: Purani file ko Delete karein (Sirf 2 click mein)
