Upar right side mein ek 🗑️ (Trash can / Kude daan ka icon) dikhega, us par click kar dein.
Niche jaakar Commit changes... par click karke use permanently delete kar dein. Ab purana jhanjhat khatam!
Step 2: Nayi File Banayein (Sahi code ke sath)
Ab apni repository ke main page par wapas aayein.
Wahan upar right side mein Add file ka option hoga, uspar click karke Create new file chunyein.
Name your file... wale khali dibbe mein bilkul yahi naam likhein: vite.config.ts
Niche diye gaye badaye khali box mein thodi der ungli daba kar rakhein (Long Press) aur Paste par click kar dein. (Naya code neeche box se copy kar lijiye).
